001100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
001200 PROGRAM-ID.          TSPLPRT.
001300 AUTHOR.              C HILLES.
001400 DATE-WRITTEN.        7/1/83.
001500 DATE-COMPILED.
001600*INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
001700*SECURITY.
001800*REMARKS.  THIS SUBROUTINE FINDS THE SPOOLER NUMBER FOR ANY
001900*          USER/ACCOUNT/TERMINAL.  SINCE THIS IS LIKELY TO BE AN
002000*          OFTEN-CALLED ROUTINE, I HAVE PLACED IT IN THE PUB SL.
002100*          IT ALSO RETURNS USER NAME, ACCOUNT, AND TERMINAL
002200*          NUMBER TO THE CALLING PROGRAM.  CIH.
002300*
      *C  12/15/93   JEFF BUNGO  REQ #6358 (AS400 ONLY)
      *C     IMPROVED THE FUNCTIONALITY OF THIS PROGRAM TO ALLOW
      *C     MORE OPTIONS TO RETRIEVE THE SPOOLER NUMBERS IF THE
      *C     USER AND TERMINAL COMBINATION IS NOT FOUND IN THE
      *C     PRINT FILE.  THE PROGRAM WILL FIND THE SPOOLER
      *C     NUMBERS IN THE FOLLOWING ORDER:
      *C         1. BY USER AND TERMINAL COMBINATION
      *C                   if not found, then
      *C         2. BY USER AND GENERIC TERMINAL COMBINATION
      *C                   if not found, then
      *C         3. BY GENERIC USER AND TERMINAL COMBINATION
      *C                   if not found, then
      *C         4. BY GENERIC USER AND GENERIC TERMINAL COMBINATION
      *C                   if not found, then
      *C         5. DEFAULT SPOOLERS TO ZERO.
      *C     A GENERIC USER OR TERMINAL, AS DEFINED BY THE
      *C     SPOOLER MAINTENANCE PROGRAM TUSERPRT, WILL HAVE
      *C     THE VALUE "GENERIC".

004900**************************************************************
005000**                                                          **
005100**          P L A N T S   V E R S I O N   O N L Y           **
005200**                                                          **
005300**************************************************************
005400
005500 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
005600 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
005700 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
005800 OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
003800 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
003900 FILE-CONTROL.
004000     SELECT KPRINTER-FILE  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCSPRNT
004100       ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
004200       ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
004300       RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
004600       FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
004700 DATA DIVISION.
004800 FILE SECTION.
004900 FD  KPRINTER-FILE.
005000 01  KPRINTER-RECORD.
005100     COPY DDS-MCFPCSPRNT OF MCFLCSPRNT.
005300
006000 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1            PIC X.
           05  FILE-STATUS-2            PIC X.

007100 01  WHO-VARIABLES.
007500     05  USERNAME                 PIC X(10).
007600     05  TNUM                     PIC X(10).
007700     05  CURLIB                   PIC X(10).
007800     05  JOBTYPE                  PIC X.
009900
010000 01  STATUS-AREA.
010100     05  COND-WORD               PIC S9(4)   BINARY.
010200     05  DATA-LENG               PIC S9(4)   BINARY.
010300     05  REC-NO                  PIC S9(9)   BINARY.
010400     05  CHAIN-LENG              PIC S9(9)   BINARY.
010500     05  BKWD-ADDR               PIC S9(9)   BINARY.
010600     05  FRWD-ADDR               PIC S9(9)   BINARY.
011500
015300**************************************************************
015500**                L I N K A G E   S E C T I O N             **
015700**************************************************************
015900 LINKAGE SECTION.
016000
016100 01  RET-CODE                     PIC X(2).
016200 01  SPOOLER-REC.
016300     05  FILLER                   PIC X(2).
016400     05  K-USERNAME               PIC X(8).
016500     05  K-ACCOUNT                PIC X(8).
016600     05  K-TERMINAL               PIC X(10).
016700     05  K-SPOOL-LINE OCCURS 5 TIMES.
016800         10  K-SPOOL-NO           PIC 9(2).
016900
017000 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING RET-CODE, SPOOLER-REC.
017100 1000-HOUSEKEEP-SECTION.
024600     MOVE 00 TO K-SPOOL-NO (1), K-SPOOL-NO (2),
                      K-SPOOL-NO (3)  K-SPOOL-NO (4)
                      K-SPOOL-NO (5).
017200     MOVE "00"  TO  RET-CODE.
017300     CALL "CLWHO" USING USERNAME TNUM CURLIB JOBTYPE.
017500
           OPEN INPUT KPRINTER-FILE.
017600     MOVE USERNAME             TO  KPRTUSER, K-USERNAME.
017800     MOVE TNUM                 TO  K-TERMINAL.
           MOVE K-TERMINAL           TO  KPRTTERM.
      *------ NOTE: ON IBM, SINCE NO SECURITY SYS, IF THERE IS
      *------ NO ENTRY, WE DEFAULT TO ZERO, WHICH WILL GO TO THE
      *------ LOCAL PRINTER.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           READ KPRINTER-FILE
               INVALID KEY MOVE "00" TO RET-CODE.
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE "GENERIC" TO KPRTTERM
               READ KPRINTER-FILE
                   INVALID KEY MOVE "00" TO RET-CODE
               END-READ
               IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
                   MOVE "GENERIC" TO KPRTUSER
                   MOVE K-TERMINAL TO KPRTTERM
                   READ KPRINTER-FILE
                       INVALID KEY MOVE "00" TO RET-CODE
                   END-READ
                   IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
                       MOVE "GENERIC" TO KPRTUSER KPRTTERM
                       READ KPRINTER-FILE
                           INVALID KEY MOVE "00" TO RET-CODE
                       END-READ
                       IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
                           GO TO 1300-EXIT
                       ELSE
                           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                               MOVE "D7" TO RET-CODE
                           END-IF
                       END-IF
                   ELSE
                       IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                           MOVE "D7" TO RET-CODE
                       END-IF
                   END-IF
               ELSE
                   IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                       MOVE "D7" TO RET-CODE
                   END-IF
               END-IF
           ELSE
               IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                   MOVE "D7" TO RET-CODE
               END-IF
           END-IF.
024300     IF RET-CODE NOT = "00"
024500         GO TO 1300-EXIT.
           IF KPRTSPOOL1 IS NUMERIC
024700     MOVE KPRTSPOOL1               TO  K-SPOOL-NO (1).
           IF KPRTSPOOL2 IS NUMERIC
024800     MOVE KPRTSPOOL2               TO  K-SPOOL-NO (2).
           IF KPRTSPOOL3 IS NUMERIC
024900     MOVE KPRTSPOOL3               TO  K-SPOOL-NO (3).
           IF KPRTSPOOL4 IS NUMERIC
025000     MOVE KPRTSPOOL4               TO  K-SPOOL-NO (4).
           IF KPRTSPOOL5 IS NUMERIC
025100     MOVE KPRTSPOOL5               TO  K-SPOOL-NO (5).
025200
025500 1300-EXIT.
025300     CLOSE KPRINTER-FILE.
025600     GOBACK.
025700
